#: ../../architecture.md:1 2a8a87d9859f48e2a2e0a72767640034
msgid "How it is built"
msgstr "它是怎麼建起來的"

#: ../../architecture.md:3 f0551fe43f6640c787d4fccba7364a63
msgid "This page is for someone changing the code rather than using it. Everything before it describes the workbench from the outside; this is the seam map — what each half owns, what crosses between them, and where a change to one half forces a change to the other."
msgstr "這一頁寫給要改動程式碼的人，而不是使用它的人。前面每一頁都是從外面描述這套工作台；這一頁是接縫的地圖——兩邊各自擁有什麼、之間傳遞什麼，以及改動其中一邊會在哪裡逼著另一邊也得改。"

#: ../../architecture.md:8 4b414d1737fd4032be63911dbac87243
msgid "Three documents are the authority behind it, and are worth having open beside it: `ql-backend/DESIGN.md` for why the service is shaped the way it is, cited to QuantLib's own source; `ql-backend/HANDLERS.md` for every frame and field it accepts; and `PLAN.md` for this client's design record, including what was deliberately not built. This page is the map. Those are the terrain."
msgstr "它背後有三份權威文件，值得一起打開：`ql-backend/DESIGN.md` 說明服務為何長成這樣，並逐條引用 QuantLib 自己的原始碼；`ql-backend/HANDLERS.md` 列出它接受的每一個訊框與欄位；`PLAN.md` 則是這個用戶端的設計紀錄，包含刻意不做的部分。這一頁是地圖，那三份是地形。"

#: ../../architecture.md:14 f2bed110f9354070b12135bf213f0629
msgid "Two programs, one schema"
msgstr "兩支程式，一份綱要"

#: ../../architecture.md:32 372a2f3194b84737a6f381e8f06725a1
msgid "The two repositories share `ql-protobuf`, pinned as a submodule in each. Nobody writes a frame by hand and nobody commits a generated binding: the C++ side is generated by `protoc` from `CMakeLists.txt`, the TypeScript side by `npm run gen` into `src/gen/`, which is gitignored. One source of truth, and no stale copy to disagree with it."
msgstr "兩個原始碼庫共用 `ql-protobuf`，各自以子模組固定在同一個提交上。沒有人手寫訊框，也沒有人把產生出來的繫結簽進版本庫：C++ 這邊由 `CMakeLists.txt` 呼叫 `protoc` 產生，TypeScript 這邊由 `npm run gen` 產生到 `src/gen/`，而該目錄被 gitignore。單一事實來源，不會有過期的副本跟它唱反調。"

#: ../../architecture.md:38 efe433da6dd548e5a96b6f23e40bc6da
msgid "WebSocket already delimits messages, so a frame carries no length prefix — one serialized `ClientFrame` or `ServerFrame` per binary message. Every request carries a `request_id` the client allocates and a `session_id`, and every request ends in exactly one terminal frame."
msgstr "WebSocket 本身就會切分訊息，所以訊框不帶長度前綴——一個二進位訊息就是一個序列化過的 `ClientFrame` 或 `ServerFrame`。每一個請求都帶著用戶端配發的 `request_id` 與一個 `session_id`，而每一個請求都恰好以一個終結訊框收尾。"

